WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Your store-specific choice starts off
Use Manage shopping measurement in the footer. This optional choice is
separate from marketing, cart reminders and feedback. Allow it
explicitly for this store and notice version; keeping it off does not
prevent shopping.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A displayed product can report a view after permission
After allowing measurement, an eligible rendered product can report one
observed view. This synthetic product uses existing frontend placeholder
artwork, not a real offer. A reported display proves neither human
attention nor a purchase.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Local stopping and server confirmation are different
A controlled local connection failure leaves server confirmation pending
while this browser stops sending measurement immediately. The saved
pending stop survives reload; Allow stays disabled. Retry server stop
confirmation when connected.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Retry confirms the stop without turning measurement on
After the connection is restored, retry confirms server revocation: the
pending warning disappears and measurement remains off. Before
confirmation or fixed expiry, an already-linked purchase may still
appear within the previous collection boundary.
